GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Sch 4 para 29(5) — a person in receipt of one of the listed payments` payments MEANS
    (payments's `care component of disability living allowance at the middle or highest rate` EQUALS `received by the person`)
    OR (payments's `care component of child disability payment at the middle or highest rate in accordance with regulation 11(5) of the DACYP Regulations` EQUALS `received by the person`)
    OR (payments's `care component of Scottish adult disability living allowance at the highest or middle rate in accordance with regulation 6(4) of the Disability Assistance (Scottish Adult Disability Living Allowance) Regulations 2025` EQUALS `received by the person`)
    OR (payments's `attendance allowance` EQUALS `received by the person`)
    OR (payments's `daily living component of personal independence payment` EQUALS `received by the person`)
    OR (payments's `daily living component of adult disability payment at the standard or enhanced rate` EQUALS `received by the person`)
